Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:05:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] fix: port cherry-picked features to Hyprland 0.56.0 API

- Replace g_pAnimationManager with Animation::mgr()
- Replace g_pCompositor->getMonitorFromCursor() with
  State::monitorState()->query().vec(Pointer::mgr()->position()).run()
- Replace CWindow::m_fadingOut with isWindowFadingOut() helper
- Add missing struct fields: WorkspaceSwipeGestureContext.deltaScale/
  rawTravel/lastFrameDelta/lockedStep, WorkspaceTransition.fromOverviewSwipe,
  WorkspaceStripEntry.snapshotHadWindowContent
- Add missing structs: WorkspaceRenderOffsetBackup, WorkspaceVisibilityBackup
- Add missing member declarations and implementations:
  shouldUseOverviewRenderOverrides, activateStripTargetByStep,
  refreshWorkspaceStripActivity, cancelWorkspaceStripSnapshotRefresh,
  and ~20 other functions
- Add computeOverviewWorkspaceSwipeFrame, hideCompositorWorkspacePresentation,
  compositorWorkspaceVisibleAfterRestore free functions
- Fix duplicate pointerBeforeUpdate declaration
- Fix gestureDistance -> gestureSwipeDistance()
- Fix closeButtonInset() missing closing brace
---
